[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806447028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115465#issuecomment-3806447028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115465","id":3806447028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i4cW0","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T17:15:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T17:29:54Z","body":"Can you provide some measures of the performance gain in this PR? Please see [here](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html), `SNAME` adds to the total binary size so it has to be justified in use\r\n\r\nNote that this:\r\n> Using `SNAME()` initializes the `StringName` once at startup rather than creating it every time the signal is emitted\r\n\r\nIs not strictly true, it initializes it the first time it is *called*, not on startup\r\n\r\nEdit: Also no need to add a list of the modified files, it's clearly listed in the file changed tab so it's just noise","author_associat